    <name>
      <text>3.1 Combining mixed fractions</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p></p><p>Evaluate the following calculations using a / to enter a fraction:</p><p>a) Give your answer as an improper fraction in its lowest terms.&nbsp;</p><p>\[ \frac{{@aa@}}{{@bb@}} + \frac{{@cc@}}{{@dd@}} \]</p><p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt1]]</p><p><br></p><p></p><p>b)&nbsp;Give your answer as a mixed number in its lowest terms.</p><p>\[ {@uu@}\frac{{@vv@}}{{@ww@}} \div {@xx@}\frac{{@yy@}}{{@zz@}} \]</p><p><br></p><p>Enter the integer part and fraction part of your question separately:</p><p>[[input:ans2]] [[input:ans3]]<br></p><p>[[validation:ans2]]&nbsp;[[validation:ans3]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt2]]<br></p><p></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
